WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.001
"I love rain!" Rex said.

2
00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:14.756
"It feels cool!"

3
00:00:14.757 --> 00:00:25.603
Rex danced in the rain.

4
00:00:25.604 --> 00:00:30.810
Then he found a big puddle.

5
00:00:30.811 --> 00:00:32.519
Splash!

6
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.318
Rex stomped.

7
00:00:34.319 --> 00:00:41.997
Water went everywhere!

8
00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:46.207
Sara and Sid came over.

9
00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:53.409
"Oh, puddles!" Sara said.

10
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.356
Stomp!

11
00:00:55.357 --> 00:00:58.405
Water splashed on Sid.

12
00:00:58.406 --> 00:01:04.714
"Ha-ha!" Sid laughed.

13
00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:08.129
Sid swung his tail into a mud pit.

14
00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.596
Sploosh!

15
00:01:09.597 --> 00:01:15.853
Mud splashed on Rex and Sara.

16
00:01:15.854 --> 00:01:24.667
"Ha-ha!" Rex and Sara laughed.

17
00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:27.654
Tor came along.

18
00:01:27.655 --> 00:01:42.384
"Tor, play with us!" Sid said.

19
00:01:42.385 --> 00:01:46.647
Tor held her bag. "No way."

20
00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:49.472
"It's fun," Sara said.

21
00:01:49.473 --> 00:01:51.480
Tor shook her head.

22
00:01:51.481 --> 00:01:54.090
"I don't want to get muddy."

23
00:01:54.091 --> 00:01:58.395
Just then lightning struck. Crack!

24
00:01:58.396 --> 00:02:02.922
The rain fell harder.

25
00:02:02.923 --> 00:02:05.523
Tor looked around.

26
00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.149
She saw a cave.

27
00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:10.356
"Quick!" Tor said.

28
00:02:10.357 --> 00:02:15.467
"Let's go in that cave!"

29
00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:24.404
The buddies ran into the cave.

30
00:02:24.405 --> 00:02:29.200
"Whoa!" Rex said.

